DO NOT COMMIT a real google-services.json.
1. Create a Firebase project at https://console.firebase.google.com.
2. Add an Android app with applicationId `es.schsebastian.foodrats`.
3. Add an OAuth 2.0 Web client (type "Web application") in the Cloud console
   credentials page; this is the SERVER client id Credential Manager needs.
4. Download google-services.json and place it at androidApp/google-services.json.
5. Add to your local ~/.gradle/gradle.properties (NOT to the repo):
       googleServerClientId=YOUR_WEB_CLIENT_ID.apps.googleusercontent.com
6. Re-run :androidApp:assembleDebug.
